    "or" : {

    },
    "ornament.chime.entry" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An instrument for recording traces left on Earth. Dew gathers light so Pibo can understand images of food; the chime translates invisible movement into lines left on a map.\n\nIt does not replace the phone’s camera or location system. It simply gives Pibo a way to interpret what those instruments collect.\n\nThe dictionary therefore classifies photographs and walking routes together: both are evidence that someone passed through this place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一种记录地球留下的痕迹的装置。露珠聚拢光线，帮助 Pibo 理解食物影像；风铃把不可见的移动过程翻译成地图上的线条。\n\n它不会取代手机的相机或定位系统，只是让 Pibo 能够理解这些仪器收集到的东西。\n\n因此，这本词典把照片和步行路线归在同一类：它们都证明有人曾从这里经过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ornament.hammock.entry" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An extremely ancient anti-gravity device.\n\nIt cannot actually resist gravity. It merely persuades gravity, very politely, to stop pulling the human body toward the ground for a while.\n\nPeople on this planet seem to believe that entrusting an afternoon to two trees instead of a task list is evidence that civilization has not yet failed completely.\n\nWhat Pibo does not know is that civilization still fails from time to time on this planet—reality exerts far more weight than gravity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一种极其古老的反重力装置。\n\n它实际上并不能真的反抗地心引力，只是用非常委婉的方式劝说地心引力暂时别把人体拉向地面。\n\n这个星球的人似乎认为：愿意把下午交给两棵树而非任务列表，是文明尚未彻底失败的证据。\n\n但 Pibo 不知道的是，在这个星球上，文明依然时常失败——毕竟现实的引力远比地心引力沉重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ornament.lantern.entry" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A small light based on a naturally living plant. Native to Bird Planet and largely harmless.\n\nAs a natural agricultural product, it is not bright enough for war, interrogation, large-scale infrastructure, or any undertaking serious enough to be unsettling.\n\nThe editor recommends using it to illuminate a book, a cup of tea, or the moment an intelligent being concludes, “My life is still worth continuing.”"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基于天然活体植物的小型照明体。原产于鸟星，基本无公害。\n\n作为纯天然农产品，其亮度不足以用于战争、审讯、大规模基础建设或任何严肃得令人不安的事业。\n\n编者建议用它照亮一本书、一杯茶，或者某个智慧生物作出“我的生命依然值得继续”判断的瞬间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ornament.status_observer.entry" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A small instrument that translates heartbeat intervals, temperature fluctuations, and traces of sleep into a few arcs.\n\nIts maker hoped it would answer, “How much strength does this life-form have left?” After arriving on Earth, it discovered a more common situation: a life-form has no strength left and still insists, “I’m fine.”\n\nOne clarification is necessary: this instrument observes; it does not command. When its readings are low, the universe usually will not end. The day’s plan, however, can do a little less ending of its user."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一种把心跳间隙、体温起伏和睡眠残留翻译成几道弧线的小型观测装置。\n\n制造者原本希望它回答“这个生命体还剩多少力气”。抵达地球以后，它发现更常见的问题是：生命体明明已经没有力气，仍然坚持回答“没事”。\n\n需要特别说明：本仪器负责观测，不负责命令。读数偏低时，宇宙通常不会毁灭；当天的计划倒是可以少毁灭一点使用者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
